        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "With prior clearance of the principal, duly authorized representatives of the MCCSSE shall be permitted to enter Montgomery County public schools for the purpose of performing and engaging in official Council duties and business related to the collective bargaining agreement during nonduty time only. There may be no interruption of the work of unit members due to such visits and representatives will adhere to the established security regulation. With the prior clearance of the deputy superintendent for supportive services, the same limitations will apply in other Montgomery County public school facilities.",
